{"study_accession":"PRJNA479885","secondary_study_accession":"SRP152360","title":"Co-Stimulation–Induced AP-1 Activity is Required for Chromatin Opening During T Cell Activation [RNA-seq]","description":"Activation of T cells is dependent on organized and timely opening and closing of chromatin. We perform ATAC-seq (subseries 1), ChIP-seq (subseries 2), and RNA-seq (subseries 3) at 5, 24, and 60 h of T cell activation with anti-CD3 and -CD28 antibodies in human primary naïve CD4 T cells. We report that chromatin opening at early time points is established by AP-1 transcription factor and associated with transcriptional enhancer identified as risk loci for multiple immune diseases in human naïve CD4 T cells. Overall design: Transcriptome analysis during T cell activation in human primary naïve CD4 T cells.","pubmed":"31653690","geo_series":"","n_samples":20,"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN09621075","study_accession":"PRJNA479885","blood_class":"blood_cells","class_from":"sample","title":"RNA-seq_Act.5 h + A-FOS _rep2","description":"RNA-seq_Act.5 h + A-FOS _rep2","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM3258615","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2019-10-18","attributes":[["source_name","RNA-seq_Act.5 h + A-FOS"],["subject status","healthy donor"],["tissue","peripheral blood"],["cell_type","primary naive CD4 T cells"],["activation","Act. 5 h with anti-CD3 and -CD28 antibodies"],["rna stranded","RNA-Seq Illumina platform dUTP"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR7475911","experiment_accession":"SRX4345408","library_layout":"SINGLE","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"Illumina HiSeq 2500","read_count":30048962,"base_count":2253672150,"first_public":"2019-10-18","experiment_title":"Illumina HiSeq 2500 sequencing: GSM3258615: RNA-seq_Act.5 h + A-FOS _rep2 Homo sapiens RNA-Seq"}],"labels":[],"single_cell":false},{"sample_accession":"SAMN09621076","study_accession":"PRJNA479885","blood_class":"blood_cells","class_from":"sample","title":"RNA-seq_Act.5 h + A-FO